{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Diceball: Where Strategy Meets Chance in the Ultimate Tabletop Sports Showdown!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roll the dice and dominate the field in Diceball, a unique turn-based sports strategy game where your management skills are just as important as your luck. Take control of one of 8 distinct teams (7 to unlock) and guide them through a challenging championship run where every roll matters. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Championship Challenge:</strong> Battle and win your way through 10 consecutive games to claim the ultimate Diceball trophy. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategic Team Building:</strong> Visit the Concession Stand between wins to purchase powerful upgrades and consumable cards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Teams: </strong>Start with the default team, the Rain Delay Bay Rookies, and win to unlock 7 more teams, each with unique starting abilities and play-styles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collectible Card System:</strong> Build your Card Binder with new cards unlocked throughout your various championship runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Risk vs. Reward Gameplay:</strong> Make tough decisions that could lead to glorious victory or crushing defeat! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you master the perfect balance of strategy and chance to become the Diceball Champion? Every game brings new challenges and opportunities in this addictive baseball management experience! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666980?t=1746151915","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666980/5131e541b75107993e03531b2122aebb523d5544/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746151915","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstat